Package: confidis
Version: ${VERSION}
Architecture: ${ARCHITECTURE}
Maintainer: CONFIDIS Team <team@confidis.eu>
Installed-Size: ${INSTALLED_SIZE}
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.17), libssl3 | libssl1.1, adduser
Homepage: https://confidis.eu
Description: CONFIDIS decentralized storage node, CLI, and web UI
 The CONFIDIS package installs three components in one:
 .
  * confidis  — command-line client and node daemon entrypoint
  * web-ui — browser dashboard bundled at /usr/share/confidis/webui
  * docs   — node-hosted marketing/user/operator/admin web surface
 .
 After installation:
   1. The package creates /etc/confidis/node.json with a unique company node id
   2. The confidis service starts immediately on 127.0.0.1:4433
   3. For a pilot, add TLS/reverse proxy, public endpoint and production_profile
 .
 The setup template binds only to 127.0.0.1:4433, so installation alone
 starts a local node without exposing it to the Internet. The bundled web UI
 is served from /ui/.
